OL,3,GNEWSANew thunderstorm warnings for
OL,4,Aparts of UK as rain set to continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued fresh
OL,7,Fwarnings for thunderstorms that will
OL,8,Fbring more wet weather to parts of the
OL,9,FUK on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe first warning is valid from 02:00
OL,12,FBST with thunder and heavy rain due to
OL,13,Fmove across south-east England in the
OL,14,Fearly hours of Thursday morning.
OL,16,FA second comes into force at 06:00 BST
OL,17,Ffor a wider area of England and Wales.
OL,18,FThis will last through to 22:00 and may
OL,19,Fbecome slow moving in the afternoon and
OL,20,Fevening.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
