OL,3,GNEWSANew thunderstorm warnings for
OL,4,Aparts of UK as rain set to continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FDownpours could bring localised flash
OL,7,Fflooding and travel disruption - with
OL,8,Fthe wettest areas potentially seeing
OL,9,F75mm (3in) of rain. Large hail,
OL,10,Flightning and gusty winds could
OL,11,Faccompany the showers and it will feel
OL,12,Frather humid for many.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
